## 本地開發環境

### 1. 安裝依賴

```bash
# 安裝 Python 3.11+
sudo apt-get update
sudo apt-get install python3.11 python3.11-venv python3-pip

# 安裝 MySQL
sudo apt-get install mysql-server mysql-client libmysqlclient-dev

# 安裝 Redis (可選)
sudo apt-get install redis-server
```

### 2. 建立開發環境

```bash
# 克隆專案
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/bakery-management-system.git
cd bakery-management-system

# 建立虛擬環境
python3.11 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate

# 安裝 Python 依賴
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 3. 配置資料庫

```bash
# 登入 MySQL
mysql -u root -p

# 建立資料庫和使用者
CREATE DATABASE bakery_dev CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
CREATE DATABASE bakery_test CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
CREATE USER 'bakery_user'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'bakery_pass';
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON bakery_dev.* TO 'bakery_user'@'localhost';
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON bakery_test.* TO 'bakery_user'@'localhost';
FLUSH PRIVILEGES;
EXIT;
```

### 4. 初始化應用

```bash
# 複製環境變數
cp .env.example .env

# 編輯 .env 檔案
vim .env

# 執行資料庫遷移
flask db upgrade

# 填充測試資料
python manage.py seed-db

# 建立管理員
python manage.py create-admin

# 啟動開發伺服器
flask run --debug
```

訪問 http://localhost:5000/docs 查看 API 文檔

## Docker 部署

### 快速啟動

```bash
# 使用 Docker Compose 啟動所有服務
docker-compose up -d

# 查看服務狀態
docker-compose ps

# 查看日誌
docker-compose logs -f web

# 執行資料庫遷移
docker-compose exec web flask db upgrade

# 填充測試資料
docker-compose exec web python manage.py seed-db
```

### 自訂配置

建立 `docker-compose.override.yml`:

```yaml
version: '3.8'

services:
  web:
    environment:
      - FLASK_ENV=production
      - WORKERS=8
    ports:
      - "8000:5000"
  
  db:
    volumes:
      - /path/to/backup:/backup
```

### Docker 命令

```bash
# 重新建構映像
docker-compose build --no-cache

# 停止所有服務
docker-compose down

# 停止並刪除所有資料
docker-compose down -v

# 進入容器 Shell
docker-compose exec web bash

# 執行 Python 命令
docker-compose exec web python manage.py seed-db

# 查看特定服務日誌
docker-compose logs -f db
```

## 生產環境部署

### 方案 1: Ubuntu Server + Systemd

#### 1. 準備伺服器

```bash
# 更新系統
sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get upgrade -y

# 安裝必要套件
sudo apt-get install -y python3.11 python3.11-venv \
    mysql-server nginx git supervisor

# 建立應用使用者
sudo useradd -m -s /bin/bash bakery
sudo su - bakery
```

#### 2. 部署應用

```bash
# 克隆專案
cd /home/bakery
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/bakery-management-system.git app
cd app

# 建立虛擬環境
python3.11 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 配置環境變數
cp .env.example .env
vim .env  # 編輯生產配置

# 執行資料庫遷移
flask db upgrade
```

#### 3. 配置 Systemd Service

建立 `/etc/systemd/system/bakery-api.service`:

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Bakery Management System API
After=network.target mysql.service

[Service]
User=bakery
Group=bakery
WorkingDirectory=/home/bakery/app
Environment="PATH=/home/bakery/app/venv/bin"
ExecStart=/home/bakery/app/venv/bin/gunicorn \
    --bind 127.0.0.1:5000 \
    --workers 4 \
    --threads 2 \
    --timeout 120 \
    --access-logfile /var/log/bakery/access.log \
    --error-logfile /var/log/bakery/error.log \
    wsgi:app

Restart=always
RestartSec=10

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

啟動服務:

```bash
# 建立日誌目錄
sudo mkdir -p /var/log/bakery
sudo chown bakery:bakery /var/log/bakery

# 啟動服務
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl start bakery-api
sudo systemctl enable bakery-api

# 檢查狀態
sudo systemctl status bakery-api
```

#### 4. 配置 Nginx

建立 `/etc/nginx/sites-available/bakery-api`:

```nginx
upstream bakery_api {
    server 127.0.0.1:5000 fail_timeout=0;
}

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name api.bakery.example.com;

    # Redirect to HTTPS
    return 301 https://$server_name$request_uri;
}

server {
    listen 443 ssl http2;
    server_name api.bakery.example.com;

    # SSL 配置
    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/api.bakery.example.com/fullchain.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/api.bakery.example.com/privkey.pem;
    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
    ssl_ciphers HIGH:!aNULL:!MD5;

    # 日誌
    access_log /var/log/nginx/bakery-api-access.log;
    error_log /var/log/nginx/bakery-api-error.log;

    # 安全標頭
    add_header X-Frame-Options "SAMEORIGIN" always;
    add_header X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff" always;
    add_header X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block" always;

    # 上傳限制
    client_max_body_size 10M;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://bakery_api;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        
        # Timeout 設定
        proxy_connect_timeout 120s;
        proxy_send_timeout 120s;
        proxy_read_timeout 120s;
    }

    location /health {
        proxy_pass http://bakery_api/health;
        access_log off;
    }
}
```

啟用站點:

```bash
sudo ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/bakery-api /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/
sudo nginx -t
sudo systemctl reload nginx
```

#### 5. 設定 SSL (Let's Encrypt)

```bash
# 安裝 Certbot
sudo apt-get install certbot python3-certbot-nginx

# 取得憑證
sudo certbot --nginx -d api.bakery.example.com

# 自動更新
sudo certbot renew --dry-run
```

### 方案 2: Docker + Docker Compose

#### 1. 建立生產配置

建立 `docker-compose.prod.yml`:

```yaml
version: '3.8'

services:
  db:
    image: mysql:8.0
    restart: always
    environment:
      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: ${MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD}
      MYSQL_DATABASE: ${MYSQL_DATABASE}
      MYSQL_USER: ${MYSQL_USER}
      MYSQL_PASSWORD: ${MYSQL_PASSWORD}
    volumes:
      - mysql_data:/var/lib/mysql
      - /backup/mysql:/backup
    networks:
      - bakery_network

  redis:
    image: redis:7-alpine
    restart: always
    volumes:
      - redis_data:/data
    networks:
      - bakery_network

  web:
    build: .
    restart: always
    environment:
      FLASK_ENV: production
      DATABASE_URL: ${DATABASE_URL}
      SECRET_KEY: ${SECRET_KEY}
      JWT_SECRET_KEY: ${JWT_SECRET_KEY}
      REDIS_URL: redis://redis:6379/0
    depends_on:
      - db
      - redis
    networks:
      - bakery_network

  nginx:
    image: nginx:alpine
    restart: always
    ports:
      - "80:80"
      - "443:443"
    volumes:
      - ./docker/nginx/nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf:ro
      - ./docker/nginx/ssl:/etc/nginx/ssl:ro
      - /var/log/nginx:/var/log/nginx
    depends_on:
      - web
    networks:
      - bakery_network

volumes:
  mysql_data:
  redis_data:

networks:
  bakery_network:
    driver: bridge
```

#### 2. 部署

```bash
# 設定環境變數
export MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=secure_root_password
export MYSQL_DATABASE=bakery_prod
export MYSQL_USER=bakery_user
export MYSQL_PASSWORD=secure_password
export DATABASE_URL=mysql+pymysql://bakery_user:secure_password@db:3306/bakery_prod
export SECRET_KEY=your-production-secret-key
export JWT_SECRET_KEY=your-production-jwt-secret-key

# 啟動服務
docker-compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml up -d

# 執行遷移
docker-compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml exec web flask db upgrade

# 建立管理員
docker-compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml exec web python manage.py create-admin
```

### 方案 3: Kubernetes (進階)

建立 Kubernetes 配置檔案（範例）:

```yaml
# deployment.yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: bakery-api
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: bakery-api
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: bakery-api
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: api
        image: yourusername/bakery-management:latest
        ports:
        - containerPort: 5000
        env:
        - name: FLASK_ENV
          value: "production"
        - name: DATABASE_URL
          valueFrom:
            secretKeyRef:
              name: bakery-secrets
              key: database-url
        resources:
          requests:
            memory: "256Mi"
            cpu: "250m"
          limits:
            memory: "512Mi"
            cpu: "500m"
        livenessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /health
            port: 5000
          initialDelaySeconds: 30
          periodSeconds: 10
        readinessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /health
            port: 5000
          initialDelaySeconds: 5
          periodSeconds: 5
```

## 資料庫管理

### 備份

```bash
# MySQL 完整備份
mysqldump -u bakery_user -p bakery_prod > backup_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).sql

# 自動化備份腳本
#!/bin/bash
BACKUP_DIR="/backup/mysql"
DATE=$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)
mysqldump -u bakery_user -p'password' bakery_prod | gzip > $BACKUP_DIR/bakery_$DATE.sql.gz

# 保留最近 7 天的備份
find $BACKUP_DIR -name "bakery_*.sql.gz" -mtime +7 -delete
```

### 還原

```bash
# 從備份還原
mysql -u bakery_user -p bakery_prod < backup.sql

# 從壓縮備份還原
gunzip < backup.sql.gz | mysql -u bakery_user -p bakery_prod
```

### 資料庫遷移

```bash
# 建立遷移
flask db migrate -m "Description of changes"

# 套用遷移
flask db upgrade

# 回滾遷移
flask db downgrade

# 查看遷移歷史
flask db history
```

